// Research-only starter knowledge for Cloudbite roles 101-110 (Falsify research expert extension; clinical, pharmaceutical and chemistry methods).
// Every card is original synthesis written for Cloudbite; no source text is quoted or mirrored.
// Purpose is document, evidence and benchmark project advice. No diagnosis, treatment, dosing, wet-lab or synthesis instructions.
// Evaluation status is unvalidated: these packs are source-linked starter knowledge, not physician credentials or measured expertise.
// Source checkStatus is 'retrieved' only when the URL was actually fetched and read (checkedAt is that UTC time).
