    inputs: 'Assumes the brief supplies the document with compound tables, assay descriptions and activity values; structures may be given only as names or images, and assay conditions and controls are often incomplete.',
    method: 'Compare claimed compound quality with probe criteria, triage interference risks using the counter-evidence reported, place each hit on a validation evidence ladder, audit SAR statements against the tables, and record bioactivity data provenance and comparability.',
